                "precision": "sentence",
                "translation_vi": "C — Một thế hệ sau, các họa sĩ Ấn tượng đi theo hướng khác."
              },
              {
                "id": "p3-s2",
                "source": "Artists such as Claude Monet abandoned the studio to paint outdoors, trying to capture the shifting effects of natural light on water, snow and city streets with quick, visible brushstrokes.",
                "phrases": [
