                ],
                "precision": "sentence",
                "translation_vi": "C — Thủy điện có lịch sử lâu đời hơn nhiều."
              },
              {
                "id": "p3-s2",
                "source": "It has generated electricity on a large scale for longer than any other renewable source, by letting falling water pass through turbines.",
