              },
              {
                "id": "p2-s2",
                "source": "People who read often tend to build a larger vocabulary than those who seldom open a book, because printed text uses a wider and richer range of words than everyday speech.",
                "phrases": [
                  {
                    "source": "tend to build a larger vocabulary",
                    "target": "có xu hướng có vốn từ lớn hơn"
