                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p4-s2",
              "source": "One popular idea is the 'fighting hypothesis'.",
              "translation_vi": "Ý tưởng phổ biến là “giả thuyết chiến đấu”.",
              "precision": "sentence",
              "phrases": [
                {
                  "source": "the 'fighting hypothesis'",
                  "target": "“giả thuyết chiến đấu”"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p4-s3",
              "source": "Because most opponents are used to facing right-handers, a left-hander may gain a surprise advantage in combat or sport, and studies of fencers and baseball pitchers lend some support to this idea.",
