                "precision": "sentence",
                "translation_vi": "Sức hấp dẫn chính nằm ở môi trường."
              },
              {
                "id": "p2-s2",
                "source": "A traditional combustion engine burns fuel and emits carbon dioxide and other pollutants directly into the air.",
