                "precision": "sentence",
                "translation_vi": "Không vấn đề nào dừng đà tiến."
              },
              {
                "id": "p5-s2",
                "source": "Several governments have announced plans to phase out the sale of new petrol cars within the coming decade, and manufacturers are investing heavily to meet the deadline.",
