                "precision": "sentence",
                "translation_vi": "Không điều nào khả thi thiếu công nghệ."
              },
              {
                "id": "p4-s2",
                "source": "Cheap video calls and shared documents allow scattered teams to collaborate almost as if they sat together, provided the necessary infrastructure, such as reliable internet, is in place.",
                "phrases": [
