                "precision": "sentence",
                "translation_vi": "Nỗi lo cốt lõi mang tính vật lý."
              },
              {
                "id": "p2-s2",
                "source": "Economic activity draws energy and raw materials from the natural world and discharges waste back into it, and no law guarantees that both flows can expand indefinitely without serious damage.",
                "phrases": [
                  {
                    "source": "energy and raw materials",
                    "target": "năng lượng và nguyên liệu thô"
